amai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615800/b5605578d3eb4c23b52ee2d5c29704f3bed3ed7e/ss_b5605578d3eb4c23b52ee2d5c29704f3bed3ed7e.600x338.jpg?t=1744708314"},{"id":13,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615800/660164bd3db2294e11f71e6600d4656b749cebde/ss_660164bd3db2294e11f71e6600d4656b749cebde.1920x1080.jpg?t=1744708314","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615800/660164bd3db2294e11f71e6600d4656b749cebde/ss_660164bd3db2294e11f71e6600d4656b749cebde.600x338.jpg?t=1744708314"}],"short_description":"Welcome to Wand Mart \u2014 an absolutely ordinary magic store where everything is fine. n\u0336o\u0336 \u0336o\u0336n\u0336e\u0336 \u0336d\u0336i\u0336s\u0336a\u0336p\u0336p\u0336e\u0336a\u0336r\u0336s\u0336 \u0336i\u0336n\u0336 \u0336t\u0336h\u0336e\u0336 \u0336b\u0336a\u0336s\u0336e\u0336m\u0336e\u0336n\u0336t\u0336 . A cooperative game for 4 players: build, trade, and, if possible, don't die. Just like in real life.","steam_appid":3615800,"support_info":{"email":"bobikstudiosup@gmail.com","url":"https://discord.gg/U6KpUQHRwf"},"supported_languages":"English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Spanish - Latin America, Simplified Chinese, Korean, Russian, Portuguese - Brazil, Traditional Chinese, Polish, Thai, Turkish, Ukrainian, Japanese","type":"game","website":null}